EN:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}All right then!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} That settles it!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
From this point forward, you are{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
